            <div class="pl-card">
              <strong>Attribution:</strong> <span class="attr-badge attr-b2">B2</span> Knot hardcoded offset removed.<br>
              <strong>Expected diff:</strong> Knot(Point(1,1,1)) geometry now positioned at Point(1,1,1). Pre-fix was offset by (-0.1, 0.15, 0.4).<br>
              <strong>Inspect:</strong> PNG must show knot shape correctly placed at requested isometric position.
            </div>
          </details>
        </td>
        <td><span class="status-badge">modified</span></td>
