          </details>
        </td>
        <td><span class="status-badge">modified</span></td>
        <td><span class="attr-badge attr-g1">G1?</span></td>
        <td>Conditional — inspect after record</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="is-external">
        <td>
          <details>
            <summary>…_*.png (25 remaining goldens)</summary>
            <div class="pl-card">
              <strong>Attribution:</strong> <span class="attr-badge attr-clean">NONE expected</span><br>
              <strong>Expected:</strong> Byte-identical to post-record output. Any diff = unattributable regression → halt, reopen owning slice.<br>
              <strong>Files include:</strong> grid, path, sampleOne, sampleTwo, translate, scale, rotateZ, extrude, cylinder, prism, pyramid, stairs, nodeIdRowScene, onClickRowScene, longPressGridScene, dragLifecycleScene, dragNodeScene, longPressConfigScene, doubleTapScene, perNodeCallbackScene, cameraControlScene, pinchZoomRecipeScene, hoverRecipeScene, occludedPickScene, elevatedTileScene.
